sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as UI / API
    participant WF as Workflow Engine / Turn Runtime
    participant SL as Session Ledger
    participant CC as Context Compiler
    participant MR as Model Router / LLM
    participant TB as Tool Broker / MCP
    participant MEM as Memory Layer
    participant EV as Evidence Store
    participant AR as Artifact Store
    participant TR as Trace / Evals

    User->>UI: submit request
    UI->>SL: append(user_message, request_meta)
    UI->>TR: start trace
    UI->>WF: start run

    WF->>CC: build context
    CC->>SL: read recent events
    CC->>MEM: retrieve summaries + durable facts
    MEM-->>CC: memory hits
    CC-->>WF: compiled context

    WF->>MR: infer(context, tool catalog)
    MR-->>WF: decision + proposed act(s)
    WF->>SL: append(decision_record)
    Note over WF,SL: Persist decisions after validation<br/>before any side effect<br/>Do not persist hidden CoT

    alt tool / handoff / approval needed
        WF->>SL: append(act_intent)
        Note over WF,SL: Acts = tool_call, handoff,<br/>approval request, state transition, message emit

        opt approval gate
            WF-->>UI: request approval
            UI-->>User: approval prompt
            User-->>UI: approve / deny
            UI->>SL: append(approval_result)
        end

        WF->>TB: execute act
        TB->>SL: append(act_started)
        TB->>TR: record tool span
        TB->>EV: persist(raw result, hash, provenance)
        EV-->>TB: evidence_ref
        TB->>SL: append(act_finished, evidence_ref)
        TB-->>WF: normalized result + evidence_ref

        opt tool created file / patch / report
            TB->>AR: persist(versioned artifact blob + manifest)
            AR-->>TB: artifact_ref
            TB->>SL: append(artifact_created, artifact_ref)
        end

        opt checkpoint hit (subtask done / context pressure / phase end)
            WF->>MEM: write(summary, key decisions, refs)
            MEM-->>WF: summary_ref
            WF->>SL: append(summary_checkpoint, summary_ref)
            Note over WF,MEM: Persist summaries before compaction,<br/>pause, or handoff
        end

        WF->>CC: rebuild context with new refs
        CC->>SL: read new events
        CC->>MEM: retrieve latest summary
        CC-->>WF: updated context

        WF->>MR: next inference
        MR-->>WF: next decision / final answer
        WF->>SL: append(decision_record)
    end

    opt final deliverable
        WF->>AR: persist(final artifact or response package)
        AR-->>WF: final_artifact_ref
        WF->>SL: append(final_answer, final_artifact_ref)
    end

    opt run-complete memory write
        WF->>MEM: write(final summary, durable facts, preferences?)
        MEM-->>WF: memory_ref
        WF->>SL: append(run_summary, memory_ref)
    end

    WF->>TR: close trace + eval outcome
    WF-->>UI: response + artifact links
    UI-->>User: final output